WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.248 --> 00:00:16.320
"We have to out of these cubes!"

2
00:00:16.940 --> 00:00:18.001
Roxy stamped her foot.

3
00:00:18.521 --> 00:00:19.422
Cozlin sighed.

4
00:00:19.442 --> 00:00:22.204
"Yeah, but how?"

5
00:00:22.985 --> 00:00:25.227
The Battle Master was still talking to the crowd.

6
00:00:26.008 --> 00:00:27.189
He gestured at the cubes.

7
00:00:27.869 --> 00:00:31.012
"The best fighters in the galaxy are in these cells.

8
00:00:31.728 --> 00:00:34.431
I brought them here to battle each other for you!"

9
00:00:35.371 --> 00:00:36.352
The audience cheered.

10
00:00:38.514 --> 00:00:41.637
"The rules are simple," the Battle Master said.

11
00:00:41.657 --> 00:00:47.462
"Each battle lasts until one fighter surrenders or gets knocked out."

12
00:00:48.322 --> 00:00:49.403
Roxy punched a wall.

13
00:00:49.423 --> 00:00:51.145
"Let us out!"

14
00:00:51.986 --> 00:00:53.327
The Battle Master didn't hear her.

15
00:00:53.347 --> 00:00:57.070
"The winner of the tournament will go free!"

16
00:00:58.091 --> 00:00:59.292
Cozlin looked at Roxy.

17
00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:02.821
"One of us needs to win and help the other to escape."

18
00:01:03.441 --> 00:01:04.101
Roxy nodded.

19
00:01:04.121 --> 00:01:06.622
"But that's not all!"

20
00:01:09.783 --> 00:01:12.264
The Battle Master paused while the audience cheered again.

21
00:01:12.284 --> 00:01:16.085
"The winner will also receive this!"

22
00:01:17.145 --> 00:01:19.246
A hologram appeared in the middle of the stadium.

23
00:01:20.166 --> 00:01:23.267
It showed an enormous, sparkling asteroid on a floating platform.

24
00:01:24.047 --> 00:01:26.928
Roxy saw the actual platform on the other side of the stadium.

25
00:01:28.532 --> 00:01:29.873
Cozlin's eyes went wide.

26
00:01:29.893 --> 00:01:35.957
"This asteroid is made of solid gold," the Battle Master said.

27
00:01:35.977 --> 00:01:40.681
"It's the most valuable asteroid in the galaxy!"

28
00:01:41.601 --> 00:01:42.562
Cozlin smiled.

29
00:01:43.243 --> 00:01:46.105
"Wow!" Roxy rolled her eyes.

30
00:01:46.945 --> 00:01:48.186
"Stay focused!

31
00:01:48.787 --> 00:01:52.169
We need to escape—not win a golden asteroid."

32
00:01:52.769 --> 00:01:53.650
Cozlin shrugged.

33
00:01:54.351 --> 00:01:56.052
"Maybe we can do both."

34
00:01:56.992 --> 00:01:58.632
The Battle Master held up his arms.

35
00:01:58.652 --> 00:02:03.434
"Let the Galactic Battle Bonanza begin!"

36
00:02:06.194 --> 00:02:08.395
One cube floated toward the middle of the stadium.

37
00:02:08.975 --> 00:02:10.976
The hologram showed the alien inside.

38
00:02:11.576 --> 00:02:13.236
The alien had sharp pincers.

39
00:02:13.256 --> 00:02:19.438
"Please welcome planet Zardon's worst villain," the Battle Master said.

40
00:02:19.458 --> 00:02:23.639
"Caladon!" A second cube floated out.

41
00:02:24.919 --> 00:02:26.720
This alien had a tail with a stinger.

42
00:02:27.300 --> 00:02:30.841
"Caladon is tough, folks," the Battle Master said.

43
00:02:30.861 --> 00:02:34.783
"But is he a match for Korax's deadly stinger?

44
00:02:35.883 --> 00:02:37.424
Let's find out!"

45
00:02:40.245 --> 00:02:43.527
The cubes disappeared, and the two aliens charged toward each other.

46
00:02:44.267 --> 00:02:47.928
Just before they collided, Korax spun around and whipped her tail.

47
00:02:48.669 --> 00:02:51.870
Caladon dodged it, and the sharp stinger stabbed the ground.

48
00:02:52.410 --> 00:02:53.270
Caladon leaped.

49
00:02:53.951 --> 00:02:56.232
One of his pincers snapped Korax's tail.

50
00:02:58.080 --> 00:02:58.981
"Ouch!" Korax cried.

51
00:02:59.661 --> 00:03:00.582
Roxy shook her head.

52
00:03:00.602 --> 00:03:02.723
"I don't like this at all."

53
00:03:02.743 --> 00:03:05.685
"Me neither," Cozlin said.

54
00:03:06.305 --> 00:03:07.806
Korax swung her tail wildly.

55
00:03:08.627 --> 00:03:09.948
Caladon moved fast.

56
00:03:10.588 --> 00:03:13.570
He darted toward Korax and jumped over the swinging tail.

57
00:03:14.371 --> 00:03:17.273
Snap! His pincers cracked Korax's armor.

58
00:03:17.293 --> 00:03:21.055
"Grr!" Korax stamped her foot.

59
00:03:22.596 --> 00:03:23.397
Caladon laughed.

60
00:03:23.437 --> 00:03:25.138
"Do you give up yet?

61
00:03:25.618 --> 00:03:26.959
Or should we keep on—?"

62
00:03:27.399 --> 00:03:30.362
Wham! Korax's tail hit Caladon hard.

63
00:03:30.742 --> 00:03:34.165
"Oof!" Caladon flew backward and slammed into a wall.

64
00:03:34.946 --> 00:03:36.527
Caladon held up his pincers.

65
00:03:37.068 --> 00:03:38.089
"I surrender!"

66
00:03:39.470 --> 00:03:42.652
Right away clear cubes reappeared around the two fighters.

67
00:03:43.233 --> 00:03:44.114
The crowd cheered.

68
00:03:44.974 --> 00:03:47.316
The Battle Master returned to the middle of the stadium.

69
00:03:47.336 --> 00:03:50.699
"Congratulations, Korax.

70
00:03:51.400 --> 00:03:53.742
And now for our next battle!"

71
00:03:54.763 --> 00:03:56.144
Two new cubes floated out.

72
00:03:56.940 --> 00:03:58.081
One cube was huge.

73
00:03:58.922 --> 00:04:01.143
A tall creature with an ax stood inside.

74
00:04:03.105 --> 00:04:05.126
It blocked Roxy's view of the other cube.

75
00:04:05.146 --> 00:04:10.811
"This fighter comes from Glomulon 9," the Battle Master said.

76
00:04:10.831 --> 00:04:14.013
"It's a planet where it rains lava.

77
00:04:14.473 --> 00:04:16.035
But he doesn't mind.

78
00:04:16.715 --> 00:04:21.118
Please give a cheer for Glytar!"

79
00:04:21.779 --> 00:04:22.940
The audience roared.

80
00:04:25.452 --> 00:04:29.439
"The next fighter doesn't look tough," the Battle Master said.

81
00:04:29.459 --> 00:04:34.787
"But he likes to brag that he once defeated Heaven's entire army.

82
00:04:35.709 --> 00:04:39.695
I'm pleased to present Sun Wukong!"
